{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "4d7125c077c83dec34e932728ee0a3e5cf4c89dffc3dda1bbb9ff4ea716245c9", "ja": "複雑な気持ち", "zh": "心情复杂", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6980dd9e0a964983e1ced55b61d4aee8b50306585f1b9971ea2ebc604a9c205d", "ja": "八幕のミーティング前、プロデューサーが\nファンレターを整理していると、育と環が\n「読みたい」と言い、全員で読む事に。と、\n「今回の公演は少し苦手」という内容の手紙\nを見つけた歌織は、考え込んでしまう。", "zh": "第八场演出会议前，制作人正在整理\n粉丝来信，育和环说想看，于是大家决定一起读。就在这时，\n歌织发现了一封内容是“有点不太喜欢这次演出”的信，\n不由得陷入了沉思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d8a3d0a8807f2d2a4b7a09d3f4ad34bcc338af13667b46a0930295cf706accc1", "ja": "（『STARDOM ROAD』公演も残すところあと二幕、\nファンレターやメールはたくさん届いている……）", "zh": "（《STARDOM ROAD》公演还剩下最后两幕，\n已经收到了许多粉丝来信和邮件……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1a308a62f4a18244ebd9a78e6fa53873c9d8fa41e8c0ea225054c80184a19c35", "ja": "（数の多さは、反響の大きさそのもの。内容の\nチェックを兼ねて、ありがたく読ませてもらわないと）", "zh": "（数量之多，本身就说明反响有多大。也正好借此确认内容，我得怀着感激之情读一读才行）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1002_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "c8f7ab2d16efed2f04415bfdc7787da9ed1f5c657e7f5ce647c31d1692583820", "ja": "あっ、おやぶんみーつけた！\n何してるの？", "zh": "啊，找到老大了！\n你在做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "06d7040114c8baa0417df1338c9b9ac956b39bef1569505dc237b1eebccdc185", "ja": "お、環か……えっ、もうこんな時間？\n第八幕の打ち合わせ準備をしないとだな。", "zh": "哦，是小环啊……咦，已经这么晚了？\n得准备第八幕的讨论了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "f92afe6fec4549a224146c60b247db5c93f89bf271bba88f7dc5976a983520c1", "ja": "環ちゃん！　もうすぐミーティングが始まる\n時間だから、いっしょに会議室に……あれ？", "zh": "环！会议马上就要开始了，\n我们一起去会议室……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "5081ae01e61022a761feff04d439f0da55c2506f51d4d35e6b234cce83766a37", "ja": "あっ、育！", "zh": "啊，育！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "0a7092cee1f303e8786aab826ef6ccb571dad07dadb249a0756b92e759e44215", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさま！\n……そのお手紙って、もしかしてファンレター？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦啦！\n……那些信，难道是粉丝信？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a3b07a55e5a7b09d3a5a021ecea81660475ff825a9904e89ecf489a31f030417", "ja": "お疲れさま、育。そうだよ、\n『STARDOM ROAD』公演の手紙を整理してたんだ。", "zh": "辛苦了，育。是啊，我正在整理《STARDOM ROAD》公演的来信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e2c705483e5f766ec28b686e4e91e08a2ff2daf2a71e921bd28371f3629327ac", "ja": "危うく、打ち合わせに遅刻するところだった。\n環、育も、来てくれてありがとうな。", "zh": "差点就要迟到去开会了。\n环、育，谢谢你们也过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "2367a8f58dbaa42e6cf9145f9da03ec990589efebdd1a6bbe4a3620f44b493a4", "ja": "どういたしまして！　えへへ♪", "zh": "不客气！　嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "38c88fbfb9af67455ad290d9eb53e69cabaf037a1f2ce09242bb143790415eca", "ja": "ねえねえおやぶん、これ全部、\n『STARDOM ROAD』の感想のお手紙なの？", "zh": "喂喂，大将，这些全都是写给『STARDOM ROAD』的感想信吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "9d9e8c81f6ee74c6830e7839c9388b5901b186a3f37fbd3c431f4755c037bb05", "ja": "ああ、そうだよ。", "zh": "啊，是啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c8ff1d710f76d493e8a9cf98173dc95ae2f875570ec43ef3a3b90e8670ebdb6c", "ja": "劇場の39人で繋ぐ、ロングランシリーズ……。\nみんなが積み重ねてきた、証みたいなものだな。", "zh": "由剧场里的39人共同延续的长篇系列……。\n这就像是大家一点一滴积累至今的证明啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "7f26da6a2dbe22f7afb2dccc18659939d4e2b39777f79d85af2a71abbed9ebde", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}さん。\nこのお手紙、わたしが読んでもいいの？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生。\n这封信，我可以读吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c0473429afff78ae5a22b7ab03086cdacbd3242f23c1e32a5e1173bc1bfcb161", "ja": "チェックしたものは大丈夫だけど……。\n演じた後じゃなくて、前でいいのか？", "zh": "检查过的内容没问题，但是……\n不用等表演结束，提前看也可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "e9fb4be36e5cfb4a09f4610528c37875de40f452ea07a28ae5543a9708feeb6f", "ja": "う～ん、ちょっとなやむけど……。\nでも、お客さんがどう思ってるのか、気になるから！", "zh": "嗯～，虽然有点伤脑筋……不过，我很在意客人们是怎么想的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "3fa28353cf765a498e03826afa6c102a72d1391526e34c963166c2a6aa24e586", "ja": "たまきも読みたい！　お手紙って、\n読むとうれしくて、元気になるんだぞ～。", "zh": "环也想看！信件这种东西，\n读了会很开心，也会打起精神来哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "42de9ccbf81216523a91978dde3f8dd4044656afee737d140676adc248c411ab", "ja": "環もか。確かに、ファンの人達の反応から、\nキャラクター像を掴むのも方法のひとつかも……？", "zh": "环也想读吗。确实，从粉丝们的反应中把握角色形象，也许也是一种方法……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "309c39bb764a19452ea9617f8c578962d01f34d1aa402f3ef0479f67e4e0f5c9", "ja": "じゃあこの後の打ち合わせに、\n手紙とメールも持っていくか。", "zh": "那就把信和邮件也带去接下来的会议吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1021_030iku", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1022_null", "source_sha256": "e49d7ab37273406cc1798ff82d488622c5c645ef54cddc07daa539a29cc8abcc", "ja": "『STARDOM ROAD』第八幕\n打ち合わせ中……", "zh": "『STARDOM ROAD』第八幕\n商讨中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "9ab89117d41917ad62754da8e7b214ae5a70d8708d6cb30c47200f7d9407c882", "ja": "「私は藍ちゃんが大好きです！　クールで\nかっこよくて、でも苦労人な面もあって……」", "zh": "“我最喜欢蓝了！不仅冷酷\n帅气，而且还有操心劳碌的一面……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "28345bf10a721734b66ce701870399ca6d08958d4e42227174550e81cbfe6dcb", "ja": "「きっと誰より『I.V.』を大切にしているのも\n彼女のはず……幸せな結末を願っています！」", "zh": "“最珍视『I.V.』的人\n一定也是她……祝愿能有一个幸福的结局！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1025_050jul", "source_sha256": "3a892ae0c5ee3826dbc14f500405b5f4aa144ac16a33237e3d7d2c011edcf0a5", "ja": "誰よりも『I.V.』を大切に、か……。\nそうだよな、あたしもそう思う。", "zh": "比任何人都更珍惜『I.V.』吗……。\n确实，我也是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1026_p", "source_sha256": "620727dee4a2da82b196536e98be2a2cb981a5904c4bc755f5a0ef7547ba400c", "ja": "熱量のある手紙だな。連続ものだからこそ、\nキャラクターに湧く愛着もあるんだろう。", "zh": "这是一封饱含热情的信啊。正因为是连续作品，才会对其中的角色产生深厚的感情吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1027_050jul", "source_sha256": "54d785c85cdb1eae349b90b27f619c02c77ccec12e42650f0f52f68a66a3a3c0", "ja": "なるほどな……みんなが繋いできてくれたって\nいうことの意味が、やっと実感できた気がする。", "zh": "原来如此……我好像终于切身体会到，大家一路传承至今这件事的意义了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1028_052kao", "source_sha256": "318320150b6ca794808f5fa7f28998a2b0d50125b45fb7121af06106233ad0c3", "ja": "ええ、本当に……。私も第八幕の主演として、\n気合いを入れて臨まなくちゃ。", "zh": "嗯，确实……作为第八幕的主演，我也必须打起精神迎接挑战才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1029_030iku", "source_sha256": "c92c88f14f534d6cac92f4e1fd254b96ff6d03e339be1b7e753f8ad3059355e2", "ja": "「前回、真珠星の母親が神宮寺だと判明しました。\nいよいよ、物語の大きな謎が明かされる時ですね」", "zh": "“上一集里，查明了真珠星的母亲就是神宫寺。\n终于到了故事的重大谜团揭晓的时刻呢”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1030_030iku", "source_sha256": "7eca6e683752145f9fc36a229b7539b5f06677b3fb324f4d68503fad8f1a4f59", "ja": "「神宮寺の過去、織姫の言葉の意味……\n真珠星がどう乗り越えるか、楽しみです」だって。", "zh": "“‘神宫寺的过去、织姬那番话的含义……\n真珠星会如何跨越这些难关，真让人期待。’上面这么写着。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1031_p", "source_sha256": "12fdc9b9141658183eba223defd5521eb4f8ad1d1461b3377bf536ef4aede1e4", "ja": "物語も佳境だ。純粋にストーリーを\n楽しみにしてくれている人も多いな。", "zh": "故事也进入高潮了。看来有不少人是真心期待着剧情的发展。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1032_030iku", "source_sha256": "01e295e6222a146b2322f1b6d22517c664554dfacf4307301f760b2bd849905f", "ja": "大人っぽいお話になってきたもんね。\nわたしの出番が後半なのも、なっとくかな。", "zh": "故事变得越来越成熟了呢。\n我的出场安排在后半段，也能理解了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1033_030iku", "source_sha256": "ac3b1f239c7196833e09e544427f30688499784eaec0fdc06be96a3444275187", "ja": "役が桃子ちゃんと同じ真珠星だから、\nがんばらなくっちゃ！", "zh": "角色和桃子一样是真珠星，\n我得好好加油才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1034_040tam", "source_sha256": "7bfab70fb1e1b8066e328183dcd3521e82d35bb79a52cfa3f7fc55d216344fd7", "ja": "ねえねえ、おやぶん！　たまきがやる織姫って、\nうみみがやってた役と同じだよね？", "zh": "喂喂，老大！环演的织女，和海美演的角色是一样的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1035_p", "source_sha256": "672380c53c3bc4d41682f3c1eff2d0a3680010c697944d91c87c4962de95a25d", "ja": "うん、そうだ。\n真珠星のお姉さんだな。", "zh": "嗯，没错。\n是真珠星的姐姐呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1036_030iku", "source_sha256": "875fb8bd728fc1f3bfe98a7fa14e4f93cd79b592b5daddc85e904a38d3bd92c4", "ja": "環ちゃん、いっしょに一幕の研究しない？\n一幕の真珠星は、桃子ちゃんだし……。", "zh": "环，我们一起研究一下第一幕吧？  \n第一幕里的真珠星，是桃子嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1037_040tam", "source_sha256": "59e520a92e71805652c544ef4429edaa9396043fc22e0784669429f348887b5a", "ja": "うん！　研究？って何すればいいのかわかんないけど、\nたまきも、育といっしょに研究するぞー！　くふふ♪", "zh": "嗯！虽然不知道“研究”是要做什么，不过环也要和育一起研究！嘿嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1038_030iku", "source_sha256": "2a51b0a43599d77cd830291aca6845696a59508cc9df5317696af7c4457a132f", "ja": "だいじょうぶだよ！　ジュリアさんと歌織さんの\n意見も聞いて、参考にさせてもらおう！", "zh": "没问题！我们也听听茱莉亚先生和歌织小姐的意见，参考一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1039_p", "source_sha256": "64617876b1f3838813f4ca1d9fd20740e4a4d7ca138267934030607765192a58", "ja": "育と環はもうやる気全開みたいだな。\nうん、何よりだ。", "zh": "育和环好像已经干劲十足了啊。嗯，这样最好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1040_050jul", "source_sha256": "2b0768e0566c80e7bb81b6b85fc6154bf9e800d9a10a7bcdf3a7224e0a427e43", "ja": "ははっ。あたしとカオリよりも、\n小学生二人の方が肝が据わってるみたいだな。", "zh": "哈哈。看起来比起我和歌织，\n两个小学生反而更沉得住气呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1041_052kao", "source_sha256": "6f2f359a2c865c517ee80638897372de45a4f5ab76fb972ae0543c1d6887c8b3", "ja": "そうね、私たちも見習わなくちゃ。\nこのお手紙は……まだ読んでなかったわね。", "zh": "是啊，我们也得向她们学习才行。\n这封信……我们还没读过呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1042_052kao", "source_sha256": "96f67a8058db066ba0c3ddf1730c90f7c331c62357189225d5af4d6a21fe72d4", "ja": "「はじめてお便りします。私は765プロの大ファンで\nこれまでの演劇公演もすべて観てきました」……", "zh": "“第一次给您写信。我是765制作人的忠实粉丝，之前的戏剧公演也全都看过”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1043_052kao", "source_sha256": "66902b0127c929488b803a96eacc38e1e3f85ee391695bb182b06c443542c72a", "ja": "「ただ今回の『STARDOM ROAD』公演は、不安と\n戸惑いの中で観ています。正直、少し苦手です」……？", "zh": "“不过这次的《STARDOM ROAD》公演，我是在不安和困惑中观看的。说实话，我有点不太适应”……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1044_030iku", "source_sha256": "63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a", "ja": "えっ……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1046_052kao", "source_sha256": "9dbc653008745be9b2ff99fe10cd6196a12ac09747c64e0b63424a76016f3c11", "ja": "「今までのフィクション性の強い内容と違う、\nアイドル業界の話。かつリアリティもあって……」", "zh": "“和之前那些虚构性很强的内容不同，这是关于偶像业界的故事，而且还很有真实感……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1047_052kao", "source_sha256": "7abef831a8d21d4b5df67f3f65e81fc133ac0282ea7f295e3bc2b702d84eae47", "ja": "「役でしかないキャラを本当かもと思い込んで、\n勝手にショックを受けたりもします」", "zh": "“甚至误以为角色就是现实中的真实情况，\n结果自己擅自大受打击”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1048_052kao", "source_sha256": "ce2202248d2e2b7670b0ab9c51b99a5f800a6202bfe0d788b3216029caa1d2bc", "ja": "「繊細だという自覚もありますが、こういう\nファンもいることを覚えておいてほしいです」", "zh": "「我也清楚自己心思敏感，但还是希望你们\n能记住，也是有我这样的粉丝存在的」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1049_052kao", "source_sha256": "755aeb7d538fc7b8e2758e2b805697c4bd9fae56a722000058944cbcd373a140", "ja": "……。\nこういう意見も、あるんですね……。", "zh": "……原来还有这样的意见啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1050_p", "source_sha256": "db2d838e87c230d9ab1dfa6e45145e3ba27555048d8a01ac62cb8c5e9e056c9a", "ja": "（……歌織さん？　落ち込んでいる、\nというわけではなさそうだけど……）", "zh": "（……歌织小姐？看起来倒不像是在消沉……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_01_1052_p", "source_sha256": "11e78a770326dbe306d92ac164e07b6e62ff312f5cbc1d26e4e02e26cc092a38", "ja": "（？　不思議なリアクションだな……。\n少し、注意深く様子を見守ることにしよう）", "zh": "（？真是个奇怪的反应啊……还是稍微仔细观察一下情况吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
